  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656464",
      "title": "TD: Submitting and Using the Form",
      "lectureOrder": 512,
      "videoOrder": 469,
      "sourceHash": "0a9fe70db360a3fe066c6375d6bd3d7d9a73e80fc81bc903fc5a215f629f86ed",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "-: In the last lecture, we configured our form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 11.04,
          "en": "We added some controls by placing ngModel on the inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.04,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "Now let's make this form submittable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 17.82,
          "en": "so that we can actually see what the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.82,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "For this, I'll go to my app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "I already do have a method here, which you will use later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 25.98,
          "en": "Let's ignore it for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "And I'll add a new method onSubmit maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 33.15,
          "en": "This should be triggered whenever this form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.15,
          "end": 34.86,
          "en": "by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.86,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "In onSubmit, I want to output whatever the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 41.34,
          "en": "Well first of all, we need to call this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.34,
          "end": 45.66,
          "en": "So back in the template, how can we call onSubmit?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.66,
          "end": 46.493,
          "en": "Now you might think",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.493,
          "end": 49.14,
          "en": "that a good place would be on a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.14,
          "end": 51.33,
          "en": "on this button here at the bottom right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.33,
          "end": 52.8,
          "en": "Because this is the button we click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "when we want to submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "However, this is not the best place to do it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "Keep in mind that this button here is of type submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "So if we click it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 66.57,
          "en": "as it placed inside of a HTML form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.57,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "something else will happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 71.949,
          "en": "The default behavior of HTML will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.949,
          "end": 73.68,
          "en": "to call it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.68,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "If you have a button in a form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "this button will submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 81.3,
          "en": "will send a request normally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.3,
          "end": 85.189,
          "en": "But besides that, it will also trigger a JavaScript event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.189,
          "end": 88.28999999999999,
          "en": "the submit event, that's built into JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.28999999999999,
          "end": 91.2,
          "en": "built into html you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.2,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "Angular takes advantage of this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "It gives us a directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "we can place on this form element as a whole.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.52000000000001,
          "en": "It is called ngSubmit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.52000000000001,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "and it actually only gives us one event we can listen to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "So let's wrap it in parenthesis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "This event made available by the ngSubmit directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "will be fired whenever this form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "So whenever this default behavior is triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 123.18,
          "en": "and here we can call onSubmit, like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.18,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "and to show you that this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 129.81,
          "en": "I will simply go into onSubmit and log Submitted here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.81,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "Now, if we save this and let it recompile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 136.413,
          "en": "let's go back and let's open up the developer tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.281,
          "end": 140.79,
          "en": "And if I now hit the submit button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "you see submitted here on the right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.04,
          "end": 146.49,
          "en": "because indeed, the form gets submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "Now it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 150.51,
          "en": "to see the actual values of the form though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.51,
          "end": 152.97,
          "en": "to see that form object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.97,
          "end": 154.02,
          "en": "And to see it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.02,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "we have to go back to our template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "because we're in the template-driven approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "So as a rule of fund, everything you do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "you do it in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 165.78,
          "en": "Everything you want to change about this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.78,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "you want to add on as functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "you do it in a template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "On this form object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 176.19,
          "en": "we want to get access to the form created by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "Now you learn about local references",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 181.92,
          "en": "you can place on HTML elements to get access to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 181.92,
          "end": 185.34,
          "en": "So we could place #F on the form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.34,
          "end": 188.084,
          "en": "and now we could access this form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.084,
          "end": 191.64,
          "en": "on well the F reference in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 195.66,
          "en": "And we could pass F as a argument to the onSubmit method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.66,
          "end": 197.16,
          "en": "and print it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.16,
          "end": 199.86,
          "en": "So now we know that we get the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 204.45,
          "en": "and actually this will be of type element ref as we learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.45,
          "end": 206.07,
          "en": "So if we import Element Ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.07,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "and make this of type element ref here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 211.59,
          "en": "and we output the form here, so this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.59,
          "end": 214.56,
          "en": "If we now go back to this and hit submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.56,
          "end": 217.44,
          "en": "yeah, we indeed see that form object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.44,
          "end": 220.5,
          "en": "We see some strange classes here, I will come back to them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.5,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "but that still is not what we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 226.17000000000002,
          "en": "It's not a JavaScript object created by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.17000000000002,
          "end": 227.46,
          "en": "But this object is there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 229.86,
          "en": "we just need to know how to get to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.86,
          "end": 232.74,
          "en": "And there actually is a trick you could call it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "but it's no trick, it's the default way to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 238.41,
          "en": "to this automatically created object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.41,
          "end": 241.56,
          "en": "You set this local reference equal to something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.56,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "Now we haven't done that yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 243.48,
          "end": 247.89,
          "en": "but we can set it equal to something exposed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 247.89,
          "end": 249.84,
          "en": "by this form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 249.84,
          "end": 253.83,
          "en": "Keep in mind the form element is kind of a selector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 253.83,
          "end": 256.17,
          "en": "for a directive built into Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.17,
          "end": 259.41,
          "en": "which will create this JavaScript object automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 259.41,
          "end": 262.8,
          "en": "and then it will expose some data we can fetch here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.8,
          "end": 264.48,
          "en": "on this form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 264.48,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "We can get access to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "by writing ngForm here between the quotation marks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 270.69,
          "en": "So this might look super strange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 270.69,
          "end": 272.90999999999997,
          "en": "but what this in the end does is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 272.90999999999997,
          "end": 276.99,
          "en": "it tells Angular, \"Hey please give me access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.99,
          "end": 279.84000000000003,
          "en": "to this form you created automatically.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.84000000000003,
          "end": 282.15,
          "en": "That's just something you have to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.15,
          "end": 284.58,
          "en": "This is how you get access to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 284.58,
          "end": 289.58,
          "en": "to this JavaScript object created by Angular, automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 289.8,
          "end": 294.8,
          "en": "So therefore, here where we get this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 294.81,
          "end": 296.58,
          "en": "we now still pass it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 296.58,
          "end": 298.68,
          "en": "Now this will no longer be a element ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 298.68,
          "end": 301.08,
          "en": "So let's remove this type here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 301.08,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "instead this will now be of ngForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 309.84,
          "en": "So let's import ngForm from @Angular forms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 309.84,
          "end": 313.38,
          "en": "and kind of makes sense that it is of type ngForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 313.38,
          "end": 315.84,
          "en": "because that is what we're accessing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 315.84,
          "end": 318.63,
          "en": "This automatically created form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 318.63,
          "end": 321.39,
          "en": "Now let's print it to the console one more time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 321.39,
          "end": 324.72,
          "en": "and let's actually enter something into these fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 324.72,
          "end": 327,
          "en": "to see that it worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 327,
          "end": 329.67,
          "en": "If I now type submit here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 329.67,
          "end": 333.33,
          "en": "you see that now we get ngForm object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 333.33,
          "end": 336.15,
          "en": "object which we certainly didn't create.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 336.15,
          "end": 338.52,
          "en": "And there we have a lot of properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 338.52,
          "end": 340.89,
          "en": "We'll have a close look at those later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 340.89,
          "end": 343.35,
          "en": "We also do have a value property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 343.35,
          "end": 344.729,
          "en": "And if we expand this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 344.729,
          "end": 348.69,
          "en": "we indeed see a couple of key value pairs here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 348.69,
          "end": 351.78,
          "en": "where we have the names of the controls,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 351.78,
          "end": 355.65,
          "en": "so the names we set up here on the name attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 355.65,
          "end": 357.9,
          "en": "like username and email.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 357.9,
          "end": 359.1,
          "en": "We find them here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 359.1,
          "end": 361.23,
          "en": "and then the values the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 361.23,
          "end": 364.32,
          "en": "And this is how we can submit such a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 364.32,
          "end": 365.94,
          "en": "and how we can also get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.94,
          "end": 368.73,
          "en": "to the form object created by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 368.73,
          "end": 373.413,
          "en": "We also see that our setup of controls also worked.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
